* Edit 3: Convert to common-gate topology for better input impedance control
L L0 VIN1 n0
C C4 n0 VSS  ; DC block
NMOS NM1 n0 n1 VSS VSS  ; common-gate configuration
C C1 n1 n2
PMOS PM1 n3 n2 VDD VDD
L L2 n3 n4
C C2 n4 VSS
C C3 n3 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n5
NMOS NM3 n5 n5 VSS VSS
R R2 n5 n1
PMOS PM2 n6 n6 VDD VDD
R R4 n6 VSS
R R5 n6 n2